# Ticket Tortoise: the Treasure condition is an intervening "if" (CR 603.4): it must hold when the ability would trigger and
# again as it resolves. On turn 5 Bot2 has two lands to Bot1's one, so casting the Tortoise triggers it; with the trigger
# on the stack Bot2 sacrifices Strip Mine to destroy its own Island, leaving none to Bot1's one, and no Treasure is made.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Island
Ticket Tortoise
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Strip Mine
Island x18

